# twscrape's account pool. It holds X usernames, passwords and session
# cookies once an account is added, and this repository is public. It was
# tracked (empty) until 22 Oct 2026; twscrape creates it when missing.
accounts.db
*.egg-info/
.venv/

# engine/BUILD_COMMIT is deliberately NOT listed here, and must not be.
#
# `railway up` honours .gitignore when it builds the archive it uploads, so
# ignoring that file is what stopped it reaching the build — the container
# then could not name its own commit, and the deploy verification failed on
# a deploy that had in fact worked. An untracked file that is not ignored is
# uploaded, which is exactly what is wanted. A test asserts git never starts
# tracking it, which is the thing ignoring it was for.
